        "thought_text": "Consider using dynamic programming to build up the expected time from the end of the game towards the beginning. This approach would involve creating a table where each entry represents the expected time to set a record given the current position in the game and the remaining tricks. By filling this table iteratively, we can ensure that we consider all possible scenarios and make optimal decisions at each step.",
