        "node_id": "n_11_d84b61",
        "thought_text": "Implement a recursive function with memoization to calculate the expected time. The function should consider both the option of attempting the current trick and the option of resetting the game. By comparing the expected times for these two options, the function can determine the optimal strategy at each step. This approach leverages the power of recursion and caching to efficiently solve the problem.",
